<dialog
  class="consent-dialog"
  data-consent-dialog
  aria-labelledby="consent-title"
  aria-describedby="consent-summary"
>
  <div class="consent-dialog__shell">
    <button
      class="consent-dialog__close"
      type="button"
      aria-label="Datenschutz-Einstellungen schließen"
      data-consent-close
      hidden
    >
      <span aria-hidden="true">×</span>
    </button>

    <div class="consent-dialog__intro">
      <p class="consent-dialog__eyebrow">Ihre Privatsphäre</p>
      <h2 id="consent-title" tabindex="-1">Datenschutz-Einstellungen</h2>
      <p id="consent-summary">
        Diese Website wird bei <strong>bunny.net</strong> gehostet. Dabei werden
        insbesondere Ihre IP-Adresse sowie die für den Seitenaufruf
        erforderlichen Anfrage- und Verbindungsdaten verarbeitet.
      </p>
      <p>
        Google Tag Manager, Google Analytics, Microsoft Clarity und Meta Pixel
        bleiben bis zu Ihrer Einwilligung vollständig blockiert. Der Google Tag
        Manager ist die übergeordnete technische Instanz. Wenn Sie ihn
        deaktivieren, werden deshalb auch alle darüber gesteuerten Services
        deaktiviert.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="consent-dialog__quick-actions" data-consent-quick-actions>
      <button type="button" data-consent-choice="all">Alle akzeptieren</button>
      <button type="button" data-consent-choice="necessary">Nur notwendige</button>
      <button type="button" data-consent-customize>Individuell auswählen</button>
    </div>

    <section class="consent-dialog__details" data-consent-details hidden>
      <h3>Individuelle Auswahl</h3>

      <div class="consent-dialog__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Datenschutz-Details">
        <button
          id="consent-tab-groups"
          type="button"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="true"
          aria-controls="consent-panel-groups"
          tabindex="0"
          data-consent-tab="groups"
        >Service-Gruppen</button>
        <button
          id="consent-tab-services"
          type="button"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          aria-controls="consent-panel-services"
          tabindex="-1"
          data-consent-tab="services"
        >Services</button>
        <button
          id="consent-tab-providers"
          type="button"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          aria-controls="consent-panel-providers"
          tabindex="-1"
          data-consent-tab="providers"
        >Provider</button>
      </div>

      <div
        id="consent-panel-groups"
        class="consent-dialog__panel"
        role="tabpanel"
        aria-labelledby="consent-tab-groups"
        data-consent-panel="groups"
      >
        <div class="consent-service">
          <div>
            <strong>Essenziell</strong>
            <span>Immer aktiv</span>
          </div>
          <label class="consent-switch">
            <span class="visually-hidden">Essenzielle Services</span>
            <input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
            <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </label>
          <p>
            Website-Bereitstellung durch bunny.net sowie der First-Party-Cookie
            <code>artbild_consent</code> zur Speicherung Ihrer Auswahl für sechs
            Monate. Diese Funktionen sind für den Betrieb und die Beachtung Ihrer
            Entscheidung erforderlich.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="consent-service">
          <div>
            <strong>Statistik</strong>
            <span>Google Analytics und Microsoft Clarity, gesteuert über Google Tag Manager</span>
          </div>
          <label class="consent-switch">
            <span class="visually-hidden">Statistik-Services erlauben</span>
            <input type="checkbox" data-consent-group="statistics">
            <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </label>
          <p>
            Nach Ihrer Einwilligung misst Google Analytics Seitenaufrufe und
            ausgewählte Interaktionen. Microsoft Clarity erstellt dann
            Nutzungsanalysen, Heatmaps und Sitzungswiedergaben. Clarity wird
            technisch über den Google Tag Manager ausgelöst, ist aber ein
            eigenständiger Service des Providers Microsoft.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="consent-service">
          <div>
            <strong>Marketing</strong>
            <span>Meta Pixel</span>
          </div>
          <label class="consent-switch">
            <span class="visually-hidden">Marketing-Services erlauben</span>
            <input type="checkbox" data-consent-group="marketing">
            <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </label>
          <p>
            Das über den Google Tag Manager gesteuerte Meta Pixel misst Anfragen
            und Kontaktaktionen und kann zur Bildung von Zielgruppen verwendet
            werden.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        id="consent-panel-services"
        class="consent-dialog__panel"
        role="tabpanel"
        aria-labelledby="consent-tab-services"
        data-consent-panel="services"
        hidden
      >
        <p class="consent-dialog__panel-intro">
          Google Tag Manager, Google Analytics, Microsoft Clarity und Meta
          Pixel können einzeln ausgewählt werden. Die Service-Gruppe „Statistik“
          steuert Google Analytics und Microsoft Clarity gemeinsam. Der Google
          Tag Manager ist allen drei Services technisch übergeordnet: Wird er
          deaktiviert, werden Google Analytics, Microsoft Clarity und Meta
          Pixel ebenfalls deaktiviert. Essenzielle Services sind immer aktiv.
        </p>

        <details class="consent-record">
          <summary>
            <span><strong>Website-Bereitstellung</strong><small>Essenziell · bunny.net</small></span>
            <span>Immer aktiv</span>
          </summary>
          <div>
            <p><strong>Zweck:</strong> Auslieferung, Stabilität und Sicherheit der Website.</p>
            <p><strong>Verarbeitete Daten:</strong> IP-Adresse, Anfrage-, Verbindungs- und Geräteangaben.</p>
            <p><strong>Cookies:</strong> Keine Tracking-Cookies durch diesen Service.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="consent-record">
          <summary>
            <span><strong>Datenschutz-Einstellungen</strong><small>Essenziell · Eigentümer dieser Website</small></span>
            <span>Immer aktiv</span>
          </summary>
          <div>
            <p><strong>Zweck:</strong> Speicherung und Beachtung Ihrer Einwilligungsentscheidung.</p>
            <p><strong>Cookie:</strong> <code>artbild_consent</code> · First Party · 180 Tage.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="consent-record">
          <summary>
            <span><strong>Google Tag Manager</strong><small>Statistik · Google</small></span>
            <label class="consent-switch consent-switch--service">
              <span class="visually-hidden">Google Tag Manager erlauben</span>
              <input type="checkbox" data-consent-service="googleTagManager">
              <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </label>
          </summary>
          <div>
            <p><strong>Zweck:</strong> Steuerung von Google Analytics, Microsoft Clarity und Meta Pixel.</p>
            <p><strong>Vor Ihrer Auswahl:</strong> Der Tag Manager wird nicht geladen und es werden keine Daten an Google übertragen.</p>
            <p><strong>Abhängigkeit:</strong> Google Analytics, Microsoft Clarity und Meta Pixel werden über den Tag Manager gesteuert. Beim Deaktivieren des Tag Managers werden diese Services ebenfalls deaktiviert.</p>
            <p><strong>Host:</strong> <code>www.googletagmanager.com</code>.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="consent-record">
          <summary>
            <span><strong>Google Analytics</strong><small>Statistik · Google</small></span>
            <label class="consent-switch consent-switch--service">
              <span class="visually-hidden">Google Analytics erlauben</span>
              <input type="checkbox" data-consent-service="googleAnalytics">
              <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </label>
          </summary>
          <div>
            <p><strong>Zweck:</strong> Reichweitenmessung und Auswertung ausgewählter Interaktionen.</p>
            <p><strong>Cookies nach Einwilligung:</strong> <code>_ga</code> und <code>_ga_*</code> · First Party · bis zu 2 Jahre.</p>
            <p><strong>Hosts:</strong> <code>www.google-analytics.com</code> und <code>www.googletagmanager.com</code>.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="consent-record">
          <summary>
            <span><strong>Microsoft Clarity</strong><small>Statistik · Microsoft · über Google Tag Manager</small></span>
            <label class="consent-switch consent-switch--service">
              <span class="visually-hidden">Microsoft Clarity erlauben</span>
              <input type="checkbox" data-consent-service="microsoftClarity">
              <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </label>
          </summary>
          <div>
            <p><strong>Zweck:</strong> Heatmaps, technische Sitzungswiedergaben und Analyse der Bedienbarkeit.</p>
            <p><strong>Cookies nach Einwilligung:</strong> unter anderem <code>_clck</code> · 1 Jahr, <code>_clsk</code> · 1 Tag sowie Cookies auf Domains von Microsoft.</p>
            <p><strong>Hosts:</strong> <code>www.clarity.ms</code>, <code>*.clarity.ms</code> und <code>c.bing.com</code>.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="consent-record">
          <summary>
            <span><strong>Meta Pixel</strong><small>Marketing · Meta · über Google Tag Manager</small></span>
            <label class="consent-switch consent-switch--service">
              <span class="visually-hidden">Meta Pixel erlauben</span>
              <input type="checkbox" data-consent-service="metaPixel">
              <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </label>
          </summary>
          <div>
            <p><strong>Zweck:</strong> Messung von Kontaktaktionen, Zielgruppenbildung und Remarketing.</p>
            <p><strong>Cookies nach Einwilligung:</strong> <code>_fbp</code> und <code>_fbc</code> · bis zu 90 Tage.</p>
            <p><strong>Host:</strong> <code>connect.facebook.net</code>.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>

      <div
        id="consent-panel-providers"
        class="consent-dialog__panel"
        role="tabpanel"
        aria-labelledby="consent-tab-providers"
        data-consent-panel="providers"
        hidden
      >
        <article class="consent-provider">
          <h4>BunnyWay d.o.o.</h4>
          <p>Dunajska cesta 165, 1000 Ljubljana, Slowenien</p>
          <p><strong>Service:</strong> Website-Bereitstellung</p>
          <a href="https://bunny.net/privacy/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Datenschutzrichtlinie von bunny.net</a>
        </article>

        <article class="consent-provider">
          <h4>Eigentümer dieser Website</h4>
          <p>Artbild-Fotografie, York Augustin, Rahlstedter Bahnhofstraße 27, 22143 Hamburg</p>
          <p><strong>Service:</strong> Datenschutz-Einstellungen</p>
          <a href="/datenschutz/">Datenschutzerklärung</a>
        </article>

        <article class="consent-provider">
          <h4>Google Ireland Limited</h4>
          <p>Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Irland</p>
          <p><strong>Services:</strong> Google Tag Manager und Google Analytics</p>
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=de" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Datenschutzerklärung von Google</a>
        </article>

        <article class="consent-provider">
          <h4>Microsoft Ireland Operations Limited</h4>
          <p>One Microsoft Place, South County Business Park, Leopardstown, Dublin 18, Irland</p>
          <p><strong>Service:</strong> Microsoft Clarity, technisch über Google Tag Manager ausgelöst</p>
          <a href="https://www.microsoft.com/de-de/privacy/privacystatement" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Datenschutzerklärung von Microsoft</a>
        </article>

        <article class="consent-provider">
          <h4>Meta Platforms Ireland Limited</h4>
          <p>Merrion Road, Dublin 4, D04 X2K5, Irland</p>
          <p><strong>Service:</strong> Meta Pixel, technisch über Google Tag Manager ausgelöst</p>
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Datenschutzrichtlinie von Meta</a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="consent-dialog__save-actions">
        <button type="button" data-consent-save>Auswahl speichern</button>
        <button type="button" data-consent-choice="necessary">
          Nur notwendige
        </button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <nav class="consent-dialog__legal" aria-label="Rechtliche Informationen">
      <a href="/datenschutz/">Datenschutzerklärung</a>
      <a href="/impressum/">Impressum</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</dialog>

<button
  class="consent-settings-button"
  type="button"
  aria-label="Datenschutz-Einstellungen öffnen"
  title="Datenschutz-Einstellungen"
  data-consent-settings
  hidden
>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M12 2.8 19 6v5.3c0 4.6-2.8 8.5-7 10-4.2-1.5-7-5.4-7-10V6l7-3.2Z"></path>
    <path d="M9.4 12.1 11 13.7l3.9-4"></path>
  </svg>
</button>

<script is:inline>
  (() => {
    const dialog = document.querySelector("[data-consent-dialog]");
    const settingsButton = document.querySelector("[data-consent-settings]");
    if (!(dialog instanceof HTMLDialogElement) || !(settingsButton instanceof HTMLButtonElement)) {
      return;
    }

    const details = dialog.querySelector("[data-consent-details]");
    const quickActions = dialog.querySelector("[data-consent-quick-actions]");
    const statisticsInput = dialog.querySelector('[data-consent-group="statistics"]');
    const marketingInput = dialog.querySelector('[data-consent-group="marketing"]');
    const googleTagManagerInput = dialog.querySelector('[data-consent-service="googleTagManager"]');
    const googleAnalyticsInput = dialog.querySelector('[data-consent-service="googleAnalytics"]');
    const microsoftClarityInput = dialog.querySelector('[data-consent-service="microsoftClarity"]');
    const metaPixelInput = dialog.querySelector('[data-consent-service="metaPixel"]');
    const childServiceInputs = [googleAnalyticsInput, microsoftClarityInput, metaPixelInput]
      .filter((input) => input instanceof HTMLInputElement);
    const serviceInputs = [googleTagManagerInput, ...childServiceInputs]
      .filter((input) => input instanceof HTMLInputElement);
    const closeButton = dialog.querySelector("[data-consent-close]");
    const customizeButton = dialog.querySelector("[data-consent-customize]");
    const saveButton = dialog.querySelector("[data-consent-save]");
    const tabs = [...dialog.querySelectorAll("[data-consent-tab]")];
    const panels = [...dialog.querySelectorAll("[data-consent-panel]")];
    let openedForExistingDecision = false;

    const api = () => window.artbildConsentApi;

    const syncGroupsFromServices = () => {
      const googleAnalytics = googleAnalyticsInput instanceof HTMLInputElement
        && googleAnalyticsInput.checked;
      const microsoftClarity = microsoftClarityInput instanceof HTMLInputElement
        && microsoftClarityInput.checked;
      if (statisticsInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) {
        statisticsInput.checked = googleAnalytics && microsoftClarity;
        statisticsInput.indeterminate = googleAnalytics !== microsoftClarity;
      }
      if (marketingInput instanceof HTMLInputElement && metaPixelInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) {
        marketingInput.checked = metaPixelInput.checked;
        marketingInput.indeterminate = false;
      }
    };

    const syncInputs = () => {
      const state = api()?.getState?.() || window.ArtbildConsent || {};
      const services = state.services || {};
      if (googleTagManagerInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) {
        googleTagManagerInput.checked = services.googleTagManager === true;
      }
      if (googleAnalyticsInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) {
        googleAnalyticsInput.checked = services.googleAnalytics === true
          || (services.googleAnalytics === undefined && state.analytics === true);
      }
      if (microsoftClarityInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) {
        microsoftClarityInput.checked = services.microsoftClarity === true
          || (services.microsoftClarity === undefined && state.clarity === true);
      }
      if (metaPixelInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) {
        metaPixelInput.checked = services.metaPixel === true
          || (services.metaPixel === undefined && state.marketing === true);
      }
      syncGroupsFromServices();
    };

    const setDetailsVisible = (visible) => {
      if (!(details instanceof HTMLElement) || !(quickActions instanceof HTMLElement)) return;
      details.hidden = !visible;
      quickActions.hidden = visible;
      if (visible && tabs[0] instanceof HTMLButtonElement) {
        tabs[0].focus();
      }
    };

    const activateTab = (nextTab, moveFocus = true) => {
      if (!(nextTab instanceof HTMLButtonElement)) return;
      const tabId = nextTab.dataset.consentTab;
      tabs.forEach((tab) => {
        if (!(tab instanceof HTMLButtonElement)) return;
        const active = tab === nextTab;
        tab.setAttribute("aria-selected", String(active));
        tab.tabIndex = active ? 0 : -1;
      });
      panels.forEach((panel) => {
        if (!(panel instanceof HTMLElement)) return;
        panel.hidden = panel.dataset.consentPanel !== tabId;
      });
      if (moveFocus) nextTab.focus();
    };

    tabs.forEach((tab, index) => {
      if (!(tab instanceof HTMLButtonElement)) return;
      tab.addEventListener("click", () => activateTab(tab, false));
      tab.addEventListener("keydown", (event) => {
        if (!["ArrowLeft", "ArrowRight", "Home", "End"].includes(event.key)) return;
        event.preventDefault();
        let nextIndex = index;
        if (event.key === "ArrowRight") nextIndex = (index + 1) % tabs.length;
        if (event.key === "ArrowLeft") nextIndex = (index - 1 + tabs.length) % tabs.length;
        if (event.key === "Home") nextIndex = 0;
        if (event.key === "End") nextIndex = tabs.length - 1;
        activateTab(tabs[nextIndex]);
      });
    });

    statisticsInput?.addEventListener("change", () => {
      if (!(statisticsInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;
      if (statisticsInput.checked && googleTagManagerInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) {
        googleTagManagerInput.checked = true;
      }
      if (googleAnalyticsInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) {
        googleAnalyticsInput.checked = statisticsInput.checked;
      }
      if (microsoftClarityInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) {
        microsoftClarityInput.checked = statisticsInput.checked;
      }
      statisticsInput.indeterminate = false;
    });

    marketingInput?.addEventListener("change", () => {
      if (
        marketingInput instanceof HTMLInputElement
        && metaPixelInput instanceof HTMLInputElement
      ) {
        metaPixelInput.checked = marketingInput.checked;
        if (marketingInput.checked && googleTagManagerInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) {
          googleTagManagerInput.checked = true;
        }
      }
    });

    googleTagManagerInput?.addEventListener("change", () => {
      if (!(googleTagManagerInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;
      if (!googleTagManagerInput.checked) {
        childServiceInputs.forEach((input) => {
          input.checked = false;
        });
      }
      syncGroupsFromServices();
    });

    serviceInputs.forEach((input) => {
      input.addEventListener("click", (event) => event.stopPropagation());
      input.addEventListener("change", () => {
        if (
          input !== googleTagManagerInput
          && input.checked
          && googleTagManagerInput instanceof HTMLInputElement
        ) {
          googleTagManagerInput.checked = true;
        }
        syncGroupsFromServices();
      });
    });

    const openDialog = (existingDecision) => {
      if (window.ArtbildConsent?.enabled === false) return;
      openedForExistingDecision = existingDecision;
      syncInputs();
      setDetailsVisible(existingDecision);
      if (closeButton instanceof HTMLButtonElement) {
        closeButton.hidden = !existingDecision;
      }
      settingsButton.hidden = true;
      document.body.classList.add("has-consent-dialog");
      if (!dialog.open) dialog.showModal();
      const title = dialog.querySelector("#consent-title");
      if (title instanceof HTMLElement) title.focus();
    };

    const closeDialog = () => {
      if (!dialog.open) return;
      dialog.close();
      document.body.classList.remove("has-consent-dialog");
      settingsButton.hidden = false;
      settingsButton.focus();
    };

    const save = (state) => {
      api()?.setConsent?.(state);
      closeDialog();
    };

    dialog.querySelectorAll("[data-consent-choice]").forEach((button) => {
      button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const acceptAll = button.getAttribute("data-consent-choice") === "all";
        save({
          services: {
            googleTagManager: acceptAll,
            googleAnalytics: acceptAll,
            microsoftClarity: acceptAll,
            metaPixel: acceptAll,
          },
        });
      });
    });

    customizeButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      syncInputs();
      setDetailsVisible(true);
    });

    saveButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      save({
        services: {
          googleTagManager: googleTagManagerInput instanceof HTMLInputElement
            && googleTagManagerInput.checked,
          googleAnalytics: googleAnalyticsInput instanceof HTMLInputElement
            && googleAnalyticsInput.checked,
          microsoftClarity: microsoftClarityInput instanceof HTMLInputElement
            && microsoftClarityInput.checked,
          metaPixel: metaPixelInput instanceof HTMLInputElement && metaPixelInput.checked,
        },
      });
    });

    settingsButton.addEventListener("click", () => openDialog(true));
    document.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
      const trigger = event.target instanceof Element
        ? event.target.closest("[data-consent-settings]")
        : null;
      if (!(trigger instanceof HTMLElement) || trigger === settingsButton) return;
      event.preventDefault();
      openDialog(true);
    });
    closeButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      if (openedForExistingDecision) closeDialog();
    });

    dialog.addEventListener("cancel", (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      if (openedForExistingDecision) closeDialog();
    });

    window.addEventListener("artbild:consent_settings_open", () => openDialog(true));

    const initialize = () => {
      if (window.ArtbildConsent?.enabled === false) {
        settingsButton.hidden = true;
        return;
      }
      if (window.ArtbildConsent?.hasDecision) {
        settingsButton.hidden = false;
      } else {
        openDialog(false);
      }
    };

    if (document.readyState === "loading") {
      document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", initialize, { once: true });
    } else {
      initialize();
    }
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .consent-dialog [hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .consent-dialog {
    width: min(760px, calc(100% - 32px));
    max-height: min(92vh, 860px);
    padding: 0;
    border: 1px solid rgba(24, 22, 20, .14);
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: #f7f4ef;
    color: #211f1c;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(18, 15, 12, .28);
    overflow: auto;
    z-index: 20000;
  }

  .consent-dialog::backdrop {
    background: rgba(17, 15, 13, .66);
    backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
  }

  .consent-dialog__shell {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 54px);
  }

  .consent-dialog__close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    right: 16px;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 30px;
    line-height: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .consent-dialog__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    color: #866c52;
    font-family: "Raleway", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .consent-dialog h2,
  .consent-dialog h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #211f1c;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .consent-dialog h2 {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .consent-dialog h2:focus {
    outline: none;
  }

  .consent-dialog h3 {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    font-size: 25px;
  }

  .consent-dialog__intro > p:not(.consent-dialog__eyebrow) {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    color: #554f48;
    font-family: "Raleway", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .consent-dialog__quick-actions,
  .consent-dialog__save-actions {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .consent-dialog button {
    min-height: 48px;
    border: 1px solid #292622;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: #292622;
    font-family: "Raleway", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    line-height: 1.35;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .consent-dialog button:hover,
  .consent-dialog button:focus-visible {
    background: #292622;
